    description: "The Runr-S is sold by Centr and Costco rather than on Amazon. The NordicTrack T Series 16 is the closest folding treadmill with a large screen we found there at a similar price. NordicTrack, a retailer listing and an independent review agree on a 20 by 60-inch belt, a 16-inch tilting touchscreen, 0 to 12% incline, 12 mph and a 325 lb maximum user weight. NordicTrack rates its motor at 3.6 CHP with two-year cover; one independent review lists the same 3.6 figure without saying whether it is a continuous rating, so read it as NordicTrack’s number. Against the Runr-S it has the longer deck and larger screen, but the screen is for iFIT classes, and the two-year motor warranty is far shorter than Centr’s lifetime cover. If you will walk and do iFIT walking and hiking classes, it is a reasonable way to get a big screen; if the lifetime motor warranty is what drew you to Centr, the SOLE F63 above keeps it.",
  },
  {
    id: "tru-grit-runner",
    name: "Tru Grit Runner Curved Manual Treadmill",
    brand: "Tru Grit",
    category: "Cheaper Curved Treadmill With Sled Settings",
    badge: "Budget HYROX Alternative",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NPQJFDG?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410xwXy+iLL._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":500},
    reviewUrl: "/tru-grit-treadmills/",
